{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26918","headline":"同诸公会太府韩卿宅 · 姚合","name":"同诸公会太府韩卿宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九寺名卿才思雄，邀欢笔下与杯中。\n六街鼓绝尘埃息，四座筵开语笑同。\n焰焰兰缸明狭室，丁丁玉漏发深宫。\n即听鸡唱天门晓，吏事相牵西复东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26918.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26918","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}